# Splitting a koskari `pair` into head and tail

This is the wrong way:

```
  head, tail = car(body), cdr(body)
```

This is the right way:

```
  head, tail = body
```


# Creating a koskari `pair` list using `cons`

`cons` is variadic in koskari. Do not nest `cons` calls in the tail slot.

This is the wrong way:

```
  lst = cons(1, cons(2, cons(3, nil)))
```

This is the right way:

```
  lst = cons(1, 2, 3, nil)
```

